{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"an1","chapter":198,"title":"15. Dutiyavagga","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"“Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, mama sāvakānaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ manomayaṁ kāyaṁ abhinimminantānaṁ yadidaṁ cūḷapanthako."},
{"v":"2","t":"… Cetovivaṭṭakusalānaṁ yadidaṁ cūḷapanthako."},
{"v":"3","t":"… Saññāvivaṭṭakusalānaṁ yadidaṁ mahāpanthako."},
{"v":"4","t":"… Araṇavihārīnaṁ yadidaṁ subhūti."},
{"v":"5","t":"… Dakkhiṇeyyānaṁ yadidaṁ subhūti."},
{"v":"6","t":"… Āraññakānaṁ yadidaṁ revato khadiravaniyo."},
{"v":"7","t":"… Jhāyīnaṁ yadidaṁ kaṅkhārevato."},
{"v":"8","t":"… Āraddhavīriyānaṁ yadidaṁ soṇo koḷiviso."},
{"v":"9","t":"… Kalyāṇavākkaraṇānaṁ yadidaṁ soṇo kuṭikaṇṇo."},
{"v":"10","t":"… Lābhīnaṁ yadidaṁ sīvali."},
{"v":"11","t":"… Saddhādhimuttānaṁ yadidaṁ vakkalī”ti. Vaggo dutiyo."}
]}
